{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Almohadin: escape from the basement</strong> is an indie fast-paced 2D precision platformer packed with colorful visuals and bullet hell action. Face a story-rich cartoony adventure inspired by difficult retro side scroller arcade games! It currently features 132 different levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The Basement holds many mysteries. Almohadin must take risks and uncover them in order to reach the outside world. Join him on his adventure!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157360/extras/onceagain.png?t=1745324761\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">60 levels await you with progressive difficulty and the narrative of a visual novel that immerses you in the story of Almohadin, a pillow that magically comes to life and decides to escape from the basement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157360/extras/almohadin_escape_from_the_basement_3.png?t=1745324761\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Survive and fight!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bosses</strong> - these powerful individuals will try to kill you with all their might. Defend yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rescue</strong> - hundreds of subjects are imprisoned in the basement. Make a difference and save them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Massacre</strong> - annihilate all the monsters that cross your path. Cleanse the infested areas. Restore peace!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mechanics</strong> - along the way, you will find many ways to become more powerful: alfajores that enhance your movement, weapons, teleportation pills, cans of beans that help you fly (I won't explain how...), invincibility potions, and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157360/extras/almohadin_escape_from_the_basement_1.png?t=1745324761\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Modes!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Speedrun Mode</strong> - 54 levels where you must win as fast as possible. Compete against other players to see who is the fastest escape artist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No Hit Mode</strong> - 18 levels with extreme difficulty. Taking just one hit means you have to restart the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157360/extras/almohadin_escape_from_the_basement_2.png?t=1745324761\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Run once again...</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Curiosity","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3157360/6d370a72cbca2a73aab2e45d71c33d0560f2cb7d.jpg"},{"name":"Terror","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3157360/187c8feb6f0ab6b5ad43baf06af1ed7eb43d79ce.jpg"},{"name":"Fuchsia light in the shadows","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3157360/98a38faeae4294f495340c700da4b0607bc38879.jpg"},{"name":"Brainiac","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3157360/7d8f7969c2a87597ee41484f238d447129626e87.jpg"},{"name":"Quite a show","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3157360/31c9b2f4b9e8911e75982cc6b2ac0bd277b3cc7c.jpg"},{"name":"No deal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3157360/0c049ca3cc260d2cb31471f9631d05a1a1098aef.jpg"},{"name":"*Clich\u00e9 movie explosion*","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3157360/0259ae346ecb8f2407a995538e1e130a02e977f0.jpg"},{"name":"Not extracting anything today","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3157360